pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: tag
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 40, 400, 20]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: PART 1 · THE STORY}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 66, 832, 40]
    content: {style: "$title", wrap: false, text: "How the day works: claim, investigate, answer, share"}
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 116, 832, 2]
    viewBox: [832, 2]
    points: "0,1 832,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: s1-shape
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 158, 176, 136]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: s1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 170, 152, 114]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p><strong>1 · CLAIM</strong></p>
        <p>Pick open tickets in the IRIS queue. Up to three active lanes per team.</p>
  - elementId: a1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [244, 220, 40, 12]
    viewBox: [40, 12]
    points: "0,6 40,6"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: s2-shape
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [288, 158, 176, 136]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: s2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [300, 170, 152, 114]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p><strong>2 · INVESTIGATE</strong></p>
        <p>Use the desktop tools on the released evidence. Read-only, always.</p>
  - elementId: a2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [468, 220, 40, 12]
    viewBox: [40, 12]
    points: "0,6 40,6"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: s3-shape
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [512, 158, 176, 136]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: s3-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [524, 170, 152, 114]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p><strong>3 · ANSWER</strong></p>
        <p>Submit the requested value in CTFd. Four points unassisted; one with Help 3.</p>
  - elementId: a3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [692, 220, 40, 12]
    viewBox: [40, 12]
    points: "0,6 40,6"
    curve: sharp
    arrow: [null, "arrow"]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$amber"}
  - elementId: s4-shape
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [736, 158, 176, 136]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$palegreen"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$slate"}
  - elementId: s4-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [748, 170, 152, 114]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      text: |
        <p><strong>4 · SHARE</strong></p>
        <p>The finding publishes to IRIS. Your team's closed tickets unlock its next phase.</p>
  - elementId: notes-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 326, 300, 22]
    content: {style: "$tag", wrap: false, text: WORTH KNOWING UP FRONT}
  - elementId: notes-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 354, 832, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 15
      text: |
        <p>· <strong>Help 1 and 2 are free.</strong> Help 3 is the full walkthrough and permanently reduces that question from four points to one.</p>
        <p>· <strong>Wrong answers cost nothing.</strong> You only ever gain points — try, read the next hint, try again.</p>
        <p>· <strong>Stuck?</strong> Relinquish the ticket in IRIS to free one of your three lanes. Your solved questions and points remain.</p>
        <p>· <strong>No reports, no approvals.</strong> Answering questions and sharing findings is the whole job.</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 505, 700, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: OPERATION SILENT RIDGE — EXERCISE ONLY}
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 505, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "4"}
